{"id":"wb-5-1","name":"金中都水关遗址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"北京辽金城垣博物馆","text":"北京考古遗址博物馆（金中都水关遗址），位于北京市丰台区玉林南路玉林里41号，是建在金中都水关遗址上的一座历史博物馆，为北京市文物局直属单位。博物馆建筑外观模仿了水关的外形。北京考古遗址博物馆（金中都水关遗址）是国家三级博物馆。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%8C%97%E4%BA%AC%E8%BE%BD%E9%87%91%E5%9F%8E%E5%9E%A3%E5%8D%9A%E7%89%A9%E9%A6%86","revisionId":94236709,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94236709","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/7016ac4778d501307f7828fc.jpg","title":"Liao_Jin_Chengyuan_Bowuguan.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Liao_Jin_Chengyuan_Bowuguan.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/cf/Liao_Jin_Chengyuan_Bowuguan.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"BabelStone","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"​遼金城垣博物館","width":320,"height":240}}